WEBVTT

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:07.230
So I ended up eating it.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.530
The hell is this?

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.580
We have an intruder!

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.210
Head to the 6th elevator
in section B on the 60th floor!

00:00:40.090 --> 00:00:41.760
There's no one here.

00:01:42.620 --> 00:01:44.040
Who're you?!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.090
<i>That</i> wasn't seen, right?

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:52.920
Kill her immediately!

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.210
Turn around slowly.

00:01:59.050 --> 00:02:02.180
Damian! Why are you
making such a scary face?

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:03.340
Nothing much.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.850
I wasn't able to catch 
a certain little kitten.

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.100
But it's not a problem.

00:02:08.100 --> 00:02:11.020
The entire city is within my grasp.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:15.610
Whether a cat or a mouse,
I'll be able to catch it soon.

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:20.360
That's amazing! Doesn't that mean
you'll own the whole city someday?!

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.780
What does he mean by that?

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.950
You'll know soon enough.

00:02:33.970 --> 00:02:36.160
Looks like it'll be tough doing this alone.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:03:03.200
<i>The monochromatic empty eyes</i>
<i>of</i> <i>sapiens</i> <i>floating</i> <i>within the unreality</i>

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.580
<i>Completely peerless flowing</i> <i>blood,</i>
<i>controlled</i> <i>and digitized</i>

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.250
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:11.670
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:12.830
<i>Can you see?</i>

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:15.000
<i>(BOOING BOOING) Hellacious</i>

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.380
<i>Just dark world (BOOM)</i>

00:03:16.380 --> 00:03:18.050
<i>Glitter world (NO DOUBT)</i>

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.090
<i>I can see!</i>

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.090
<i>The timing of the programming</i>

00:03:21.090 --> 00:03:21.970
<i>Yea, gotcha!</i>

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:25.680
<i>I want to be eroded away (brain wash)</i>

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.850
<i>Up the blast! </i>

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:31.890
<i>Ah, this dying world </i>

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:38.400
<i>Run like you're piercing through it</i>

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:44.740
<i>The rising flames burn everything away </i>

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:49.410
<i>Your resolve and your love</i>

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.000
<i>From darkness to the light</i>

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.480
Hey, how about it?

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.230
Hey, come on!

00:04:16.770 --> 00:04:17.680
What a jerk!

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:24.570
Hey, you have a really good body!
Stop by our place.

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:26.780
We'll be sure to treat you real well.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.160
Come on, let's have fun tonight.

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:38.290
What?

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.960
My respects.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:45.630
I-Is he dead?

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:51.360
Your greetings are always so rough, Gina.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:56.150
Sword. You look well.

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:00.230
It's been a while.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.030
I've been lonely since
you haven't been around lately.

00:05:03.400 --> 00:05:06.090
Makai Alchemists are busy people.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.780
Though it looks like you spend
your time taking care of the ladies.

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:13.160
You'll be the one taking
care of me tonight, right?

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:20.090
You're still have this Majuu with you?!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:22.670
Mia is my brilliant bodyguard.

00:05:23.880 --> 00:05:27.630
I didn't come to this city
to play around with you.

00:05:31.470 --> 00:05:34.310
So what? Did you come
here because of a job?

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.310
Damian Steward.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:41.150
He was just another thug on the street,

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:43.530
but suddenly rose up to become a gang boss.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:48.660
He's now the head of a first-rate
company and gaining power fast.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.470
That's not too unusual of a story.

00:05:52.990 --> 00:05:56.460
That's true, but his methods are suspicious.

00:05:56.460 --> 00:06:01.210
Damian is probably taking advantage
of the city's information network.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:05.300
And the amount of info is impossible
for a normal human to obtain.

00:06:06.260 --> 00:06:07.170
A Horror?

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:12.640
No. My investigation already
confirms that Damian is not a Horror.

00:06:13.760 --> 00:06:15.270
This is Damian's hide-out.

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:17.730
He has quite the security system.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.230
And this room on the
top level is very suspicious.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:24.910
I tried to infiltrate the
place on my own already.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:28.610
The security system I had
previously confirmed had changed.

00:06:28.610 --> 00:06:31.460
It was as if he knew that I was coming.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:36.700
But you still don't know
if a Horror is involved, right?

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:41.520
It's hard to deal with people
who aren't on the straight and narrow.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:47.090
Well, it's not like I'm
asking you to help me out.

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.550
What the hell? Did I piss you off?

00:06:54.810 --> 00:06:58.090
But, with Damian's capability
of gathering information...

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.810
You might find information on El Dorado.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.320
Hold up.

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.990
This is becoming a fun assignment.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.060
Thank you for coming, everyone.

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:44.100
I gathered you all today to
discuss that Damian brat.

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:47.820
I don't know how he's doing it,

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:50.860
but that bastard is making
a lot of money on our turf.

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:55.660
Hasn't he been messing with the
turf of every family gathered here?

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:59.080
That man has gotten a little too cocky.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:05.290
We families should join hands and
turn Damian's group into a bloodbath.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.060
What's going on?

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:14.970
Everyone is down outside!

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:15.850
Shoot them down!

00:08:37.570 --> 00:08:40.290
Hey, there. My goodness.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.740
A lot of big shots have gathered here today.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.750
Were you thinking of having a party?

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:54.590
Good job, newcomer.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:01.640
How did you know we were gathering here?

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.560
Old man.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.200
I'll show you something good.

00:09:16.780 --> 00:09:17.750
What is this place?

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:27.830
Hey, where the hell am I?!
Damian, you hear me?!

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.290
If you're going to kill me,
hurry up and do it!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.840
Is this your first time?

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:33.170
Y-Yes.

00:09:33.670 --> 00:09:35.470
What's about to happen?

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:38.930
The show's about to begin.

00:09:42.970 --> 00:09:44.430
Wh-What's this?

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:05.540
Hey! The old man got eaten up!

00:10:06.710 --> 00:10:08.330
What the hell was that?!

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.190
Let me answer that for you.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.010
That computer is alive.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.180
Alive? What are you saying?!

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.640
I'm telling you that it's alive!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:27.940
At first, I thought it was
affected by some weird virus.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:32.440
But since then, that computer
brings me all sorts of information.

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:38.860
I used that info to rise up
from being a no-name thug.

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:41.240
That's why I know.

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.990
I knew that kitten was
trying to get into my building.

00:10:44.990 --> 00:10:48.960
I knew those geezers
were planning to try and kill me.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.080
I know it all.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:55.550
But, you know. There's always a catch.

00:11:02.470 --> 00:11:08.680
In exchange, the thing
asks me to feed it people.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:13.230
That's why I keep it well fed like this.

00:11:13.230 --> 00:11:13.900
Right, men?

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:42.630
Everyone!

00:11:42.630 --> 00:11:45.470
Cheers to the geezers making
their way to heaven tonight!

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:47.430
Yeah!

00:11:47.430 --> 00:11:50.310
Enjoy yourselves tonight
for the sake of those old men!

00:12:02.420 --> 00:12:03.030
What is it?

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:14.330
We have two missions to clear
in order to reach the top floor.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:18.920
First is to shut down the security
system of the entire building.

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.590
I see.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.840
Even if he knows we're coming,

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:26.050
he can't do anything if the system's down.

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:32.810
To shut the system down, we'll need
a security card with Damian's DNA.

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.150
DNA security card?

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.780
I'll get Damian's DNA.

00:12:38.360 --> 00:12:40.570
Hey. How are you gonna
get something like that?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.110
Open my dashboard.

00:12:46.320 --> 00:12:47.460
Sexy.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.740
Sexy.

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:51.680
Never seen you around here before.

00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:55.620
Angie couldn't come today.
I'm here to replace her.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:13:00.450
I want to drink with you
and get to know you better.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:04.010
After that, well...

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:06.510
Looks like I won't be sleeping tonight.

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.060
And what's the second mission?

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:14.690
There is a time limit to 
the security shutdown.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:15.520
How much time?

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.600
Sixty seconds.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:18.860
That's really short!

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:22.730
After sixty seconds,
the security system will reboot.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:28.370
That's why you have to reach
the top floor within that time limit.

00:13:28.820 --> 00:13:32.870
Then, you want me to find out
what Damian's hiding in that room.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.850
I can destroy it if it's a Horror, right?

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:37.670
And the infiltration route?

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.130
I've prepared the perfect course for you.

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:54.980
Dammit.

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:57.770
This always happens to me
when I get involved with her.

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.980
So, what do you want to know about me?

00:14:03.510 --> 00:14:05.570
How about a drink first?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:07.530
Hey!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:09.170
Bring me some bourbon!

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:11.860
Hey, want a sip of this?

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.910
It has a really interesting flavor.

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.750
I don't drink juice like that.

00:14:18.020 --> 00:14:22.500
Do you know the meaning of this cocktail?

00:14:22.800 --> 00:14:24.170
Who knows?

00:14:24.170 --> 00:14:26.170
Tequila sunrise.

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:29.010
Passionate love.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:33.680
Looks like I have no choice,
but to give it a try.

00:14:43.080 --> 00:14:44.690
This drink doesn't suit me, after all.

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:55.040
H-Hey! Where are you going?!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:57.580
Women take a lot of work.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:04.420
Hey, Damian!

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:06.050
Hey. Move it!

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:07.210
I can't see!

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:08.420
What?! Jeez!

00:15:20.310 --> 00:15:21.050
Don't move.

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:25.610
What are you doing here?

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:28.440
Is stalking your hobby?

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:29.280
Shut up!

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.320
What the hell is this?

00:15:38.090 --> 00:15:42.340
Damian is hiding something in
the room on the top floor, isn't he?

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:46.090
Do you know what that thing is?!

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.300
That?

00:15:47.530 --> 00:15:49.420
I'm talking about that computer!

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:56.540
No. That thing ain't
a computer. It's a monster!

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.420
Then you shouldn't get in my way.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.940
Otherwise, all of you
will get eaten up by the thing.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:06.020
What do you mean?

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:34.510
She's taking a while.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:52.440
I'm depending on you.

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:36.320
Hey. Hey. Hey.

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:39.570
You really played us with
that pretty face of yours.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.130
What's the meaning of this?

00:17:43.950 --> 00:17:45.660
U-Um...

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:49.170
On my way back from the bathroom...

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:54.550
Th-That man told me to swipe
this card when he gave me a signal.

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:57.720
Do you really think I'd 
believe a lie like that?

00:17:57.720 --> 00:17:58.800
I'm so sorry!

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:01.470
That man was so big and terrifying!

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.560
Well, it doesn't matter.

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:08.900
I'll take my time to confirm
whether you're lying or not afterwards.

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:09.610
And...

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.400
That thing should be hungry soon.

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:13.860
Perfect timing.

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:23.210
The hell is that?

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:38.760
What the hell is this?! Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.740
No way! That bastard...

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.460
What the hell is this?!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:23.670
Don't just stand there!
Hurry up and get outside!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:28.730
What's taking Sword so long?!

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.280
So that's your true form.

00:19:37.990 --> 00:19:39.570
Is this really the time for that?

00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:42.570
Shut up! This is all your fault!

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:46.160
If we hadn't come,
you would have eventually been killed.

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:51.670
Dammit! I'm still rising to the top!

00:19:51.670 --> 00:19:53.040
I'll kill you all!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.220
Nero, you bastard!

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.150
This is bad...

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:02.740
Wait!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:06.970
Why did you save a guy like that?!

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.240
I don't get it at all.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:14.040
Who the hell are you?
Why'd you do something like this?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:18.710
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:34.390
In the end, you weren't able
to find out about El Dorado.

00:21:38.150 --> 00:21:41.980
Big-time gangster,
Damian, found shot to death.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:44.030
Revenge by the mafia?

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.160
Even though we went through
the trouble of saving his life.

00:21:46.410 --> 00:21:49.120
We don't get involved in
the affairs between humans.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.200
You leaving already?

00:21:52.910 --> 00:21:55.870
I'll be back when there's
an interesting assignment.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.080
I'll be sure to see them next time.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:00.840
And your bikini, too.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:07.760
Um, sir?

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:14.040
The lady with you has told us that you will pay
her entire tab.

00:22:18.100 --> 00:22:20.140
Gina...

00:22:32.450 --> 00:22:42.500
<i>When I close my eyes I feel</i>
<i>gentle</i> <i>arms</i> <i>around</i> <i>me</i>

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:46.970
<i>Warmth and memory</i>

00:22:46.970 --> 00:22:51.350
<i>SIGHT I can feel it now</i>

00:22:51.350 --> 00:22:55.640
<i>Without even saying goodbye</i>

00:22:55.640 --> 00:23:04.230
<i>We've chosen different</i> <i>paths</i>
<i>without</i> <i>realizing</i> <i>it</i>

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:11.870
<i>Forced forward at the mercy of fate</i>

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:13.780
<i>When I'm sad</i>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:29.720
<i>I keep thinking of your</i>
<i>sweet</i> <i>smile</i> <i>as</i> <i>I</i> <i>look</i> <i>up</i> <i>at the sky</i>

00:23:32.300 --> 00:23:34.260
<i>I want to protect you</i>

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:42.480
<i>I will become strong and keep walking </i>

00:23:42.480 --> 00:23:49.700
<i>That's how I will live for another</i>
